[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3838258655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115789#issuecomment-3838258655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115789","id":3838258655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kxy3f","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T01:20:35Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T01:51:25Z","body":">I believe it should be easily toggled via hotkeys or toggle buttons.\r\n\r\nAt this point, arguably wouldn't it make sense to have a held shortcut to just hide the entire transform gizmo? That is to say the intent is to briefly hide the gizmo without having to do the whole switch tool mode dance? \r\n\r\nWe can already toggle the visibility of the whole transform tool:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1124\" height=\"51\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/492e4c56-5138-438c-81fd-cc89c0aa4c0e\" />\r\n\r\nI think having a button to toggle the trackball exclusively seems a bit strange.\r\n\r\nEdit: Ahhhh I know, I know it should probably be a proposal. I'm going to just disable it by default as mentioned above.\r\n\r\nEdit2: ~~A shortcut would probably be better at least.~~ Actually I don't know... since there isn't a solid indicator besides actually hovering. If you add a button, you're committing some kind of specific workflow, and as mentioned above having this exclusive to the trackball seems odd.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3838258655/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3838397701","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115789#issuecomment-3838397701","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115789","id":3838397701,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kyU0F","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T01:56:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T01:56:24Z